                            &lt;div style=&#39;width:100%; max-width:550px; margin:25px auto; overflow:hidden; border-radius:14px; box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); background:#000;&#39;&gt;
                                &lt;video src=&#39;https://play.scsi.kr/?url=https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/8405924/8405924-uhd_4096_2160_24fps.mp4&#39; controls autoplay muted loop playsinline preload=&#39;metadata&#39; style=&#39;width:100%; display:block; max-height:500px; background:#000;&#39;&gt;&lt;/video&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;The common basilisk or Jesus Christ lizard is a reptile that lives in wet forest waters in Costa Rica, Central America, between the Pacific Ocean and the Caribbean Sea.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;It is a member of the lizard family with a bright green body and can grow up to 80 centimeters in length.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;Adult males have a large crest on their heads, while females have no crest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;Has yellow eyes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;It has fins on its back, with green, white, and black scales mixed together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;This is to threaten the enemy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:center; margin:20px 0;&#39;&gt;&lt;img src=&#39;https://cdn.petpy.scsi.kr/1782651775742_esoui.webp&#39; style=&#39;width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:8px;&#39; alt=&#39;본문 이미지&#39; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;This lizard usually moves little and is slow, but it is very fast when hunting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;It is an omnivore that eats everything from fruits such as mangoes and bananas to mice and birds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;Basilisk lizards can run on water, dive, and swim very well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;뱀처럼 꿈틀거리며 물속을 헤엄쳐 다닙니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;Sleeping in the water or diving for long periods of time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;The principle of diving for a long time is to conserve energy as much as possible.&lt;/p&gt;

                            &lt;div style=&#39;width:100%; max-width:550px; margin:25px auto; overflow:hidden; border-radius:14px; box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); background:#000;&#39;&gt;
                                &lt;video src=&#39;https://play.scsi.kr/?url=https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/16141312/16141312-uhd_2560_1440_30fps.mp4&#39; controls autoplay muted loop playsinline preload=&#39;metadata&#39; style=&#39;width:100%; display:block; max-height:500px; background:#000;&#39;&gt;&lt;/video&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;이 도마뱀은 새와 같은 천적의 위험을 피하기 위해 잠수합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;• Origin of name&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;The reason why this lizard was given the monstrous name &#39;Basilisk&#39; is because Europeans were very afraid of it because it was said that if it looked at its eyes, it would die or turn to stone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;In other words, the monster and the lizard looked very similar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;Another name is Jesus Lizard, named after the image of Jesus walking on water.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;• 물 위를 달리는 바실리스크 도마뱀.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:center; margin:20px 0;&#39;&gt;&lt;img src=&#39;https://cdn.petpy.scsi.kr/1782651778752_8sf86.webp&#39; style=&#39;width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:8px;&#39; alt=&#39;본문 이미지&#39; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;이 도마뱀은 일반 카메라로 촬영하고 천천히 재생해도 거의 볼 수 없을 정도로 물 위를 빠르게 달리는 도마뱀입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;It runs so fast that it can only be analyzed if taken with a highspeed camera (the shutter speed of a highspeed camera is one millionth of a second).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;When a basilisk lizard runs on water, it takes five steps in 0.25 seconds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;One second is equivalent to walking twenty steps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;The time your feet are in the water is very short.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;한 걸음인 약 0.05초 간격으로 한 발이 물 밖으로 나오고 반대쪽 발이 빠르게 움직인다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:center; margin:20px 0;&#39;&gt;&lt;img src=&#39;https://cdn.petpy.scsi.kr/1782651781389_0nuem.webp&#39; style=&#39;width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:8px;&#39; alt=&#39;본문 이미지&#39; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;물을 이겨내고 앞으로 나아갈 수 있습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;Therefore, the only things in the water are the feet and the tail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;• 물 위를 달릴 때 생성되는 힘.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;도마뱀이 달릴 때 물과 상호작용하는 세 가지 힘이 있습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;First, friction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;물 위를 밟는 원리는 땅을 밟는 것과 마찬가지로 발이 물 표면에 닿아 있는 것입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:center; margin:20px 0;&#39;&gt;&lt;img src=&#39;https://cdn.petpy.scsi.kr/1782651783724_hz9ln.webp&#39; style=&#39;width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:8px;&#39; alt=&#39;본문 이미지&#39; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;When your feet enter the water quickly, resistance is created.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;The second is the actionreaction law (Newton&#39;s law of motion).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;The reaction of the feet pressing against the water and the water pushing the feet at the same time makes the lizard float.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;세 번째 힘은 부력이다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;발이 공중에 떠서 물에 들어가면 공기와 함께 물 속으로 들어갑니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;At this time, the air surrounding the foot acts as a bladder.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:center; margin:20px 0;&#39;&gt;&lt;img src=&#39;https://cdn.petpy.scsi.kr/1782651786490_opu6k.webp&#39; style=&#39;width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:8px;&#39; alt=&#39;본문 이미지&#39; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;Therefore, the body does not sink due to these forces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;These forces all occur when you place a strong foot on the water and move your other foot before sinking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;When viewed from the front when running on water, it appears as if the legs are spread wide and stretched out to the sides.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;To run fast, you move your legs as if you were rotating your arms quickly and widely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;However, you cannot run on water with just your legs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;뒷발에도 도움이 됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;There are scaly wrinkles on the entire hind toes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;It is normally folded and only unfolds when it touches water.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;Because of these wrinkles, the area where the water and feet come in contact with each other expands, and the water resistance increases accordingly.&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://petpy.scsi.kr/2026/06/basilisk-lizard.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (라이프가이드)</author><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-4459018953838708357.post-5618629633511540054</guid><pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 12:59:31 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2026-06-28T05:59:31.321-07:00</atom:updated><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">Mongoose몽구</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">petpy</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">구멍</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">등을</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">몽구스</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">몽구스과에</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">몽구스는</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">있지만</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">체계적인</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">코브라</category><title>Mongoose(몽구스)</title><description>&lt;style&gt;
